{
  "schema": "lgpe-gamedata-v1",
  "format": "LGPE-message",
  "lines": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "id": "msg_t007r0504_denkigroup_01",
      "hash": "524907406bf4611c",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "我准备给女朋友买个礼物来着。\\c\\n如果送她水之石，\\n不知道她会不会进个化啥的。"
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "id": "msg_t007r0504_boyscout_01",
      "hash": "b239d6a10194de76",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "使用进化之石\\n可以让一些宝可梦进化哦！"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "id": "msg_t007r0504_partner_01",
      "hash": "3893480216768e80",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "……哼。"
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "id": "msg_t007r0504_boyscout_02",
      "hash": "b239d5a10194dcc3",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "……你的[VAR POKNAME(0002)]似乎\\n想维持现在的样子\\r\\n和你在一起呢！"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "id": "msg_t007r0504_staffm_01",
      "hash": "d41778eac0d170b1",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "虽然这里没有卖……\\c\\n这个世界上似乎有一种叫作\\n“超级石”的很厉害的石头。"
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "id": "msg_t007r0504_kanban_01",
      "hash": "6d9f03713490430f",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "４楼……　诚心诚意送礼！\\n聪明人礼品店！\\c\\n现在正在举办\\n宝可梦进化之石大促销！"
    }
  ],
  "unpaired_labels": [
